    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d579">

                <pb facs="0771" n="677" sameAs="frus:frus1896/pg677"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Dupuy de Lôme to
                        Mr. Olney.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of Spain</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1896-03-31"><hi rendition="#italic">March 31,
                        1896</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Secretary</hi>: I have the honor to inform your
                    excellency that your note No. 108, of yesterday’s date, has reached me, and,
                    having acquainted myself with its contents, I send copy of it to His Excellency
                    the Governor-General of the Island of Cuba.</p>
                <p>I improve, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">E. Dupuy de Lôme.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
